+Triton model repository layout and deployment notes
+
+- Layout:
+  - model-repo/
+    - my_model/
+      - 1/
+        - model.onnx (or saved model files)
+      - config.pbtxt
+
+- To add a model into the PVC-backed repo from a CI job or operator host:
+  - Option A (CI uploads to S3 and operator syncs): upload to S3 and copy into PVC using a short-lived helper pod.
+  - Option B (CI pushes directly via kubectl cp for staging).
+
+Example push script: ops/triton/push_model_to_repo.sh
