+Autoscaler tuning recommendations (KEDA + autoscale_guard)
+
+- For latency-sensitive inference:
+  - Set minReplicaCount >= 1 to avoid cold starts.
+  - cooldownPeriod: 300s (5 minutes) to avoid rapid oscillation.
+  - pollingInterval: 10-30s depending on metric freshness.
+- Use a combination of queue-length (prometheus) and GPU utilization:
+  - primary trigger: queue length or pending requests
+  - secondary guard: gpu utilization thresholds enforced by autoscale_guard script (increase cooldown or cap maxReplicaCount if oscillation detected)
+- Example safe values:
+  - minReplicaCount: 1
+  - maxReplicaCount: 10 for small clusters, scale accordingly
+  - KEDA cooldownPeriod: 300
+  - autoscale_guard N_EVENTS: 5 in WINDOW_MIN: 10
+
